<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Look away from all around—Hallelujah,</l><l>Look away from all the strife and din;</l><l>Look away where peace is found—Hallelujah,</l><l>Look away from everything to Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Look away from fickle soul—Hallelujah,</l><l>Look away from failing self within;</l><l>Look away toward the goal—Hallelujah,</l><l>Look away from everything to Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Look away from all the past—Hallelujah,</l><l>Look away from both the good and sin;</l><l>To the living One hold fast—Hallelujah,</l><l>Look away from everything to Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Look away into His face—Hallelujah,</l><l>He who’ll finish what He did begin.</l><l>O what grace to run the race—Hallelujah—</l><l>We obtain by looking off to Him!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
